Author: Terraria 3D mod team

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 7
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low title IDs this plugin is compatible with
    - 0x0016A900   # Terraria (USA)

Title: Terraria 3D mod (Old 3DS)

Summary: Old 3DS build - layered stereo 3D, 30 fps lock, zoom and UI fixes for Terraria 3DS (v5.6.0)

Description: |
  Terraria 3D mod v0.7.0 for Old 3DS / Old 3DS XL / 2DS.
  New 3DS owners: use the regular (v0.5.x) build.
  Requires Terraria USA (000400000016A900) with update v5.6.0.
  The plugin verifies the game code before patching and
  refuses to patch any other version.

Compatibility: Any

# Old 3DS: Luma charges the plugin block to the game's own memory limit,
# so every MiB here is a MiB less game heap (v0.6.0 crashed with 5MiB).
MemorySize: 2MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
